WEBVTT

00:03.730 --> 00:04.900
Honoka!

00:04.900 --> 00:06.150
Honoka-chan!

00:06.150 --> 00:08.150
Honoka, are you all right?

00:08.150 --> 00:09.570
Onee-chan!

00:10.450 --> 00:11.370
What?

00:11.370 --> 00:12.200
What just happened?

00:12.200 --> 00:13.120
She collapsed!

00:13.120 --> 00:14.120
Is she gonna be okay?

00:14.120 --> 00:17.580
I apologize for the interruption, but one of our members had an accident.

00:17.580 --> 00:19.670
Please give us a minute.

00:19.670 --> 00:20.580
Onee-chan...

00:20.580 --> 00:22.170
We're continuing with the show, aren't we?

00:23.590 --> 00:26.050
We're not giving up now, right?

00:26.050 --> 00:26.760
Right?!

00:28.010 --> 00:29.680
I don't think Honoka-chan's coming back.

00:30.390 --> 00:31.180
Plus...

00:39.020 --> 00:39.060
Love Live!

00:50.780 --> 00:55.910
Sincerity is what links us together

00:55.910 --> 00:58.330
We may be serious, but we're still inexperienced

00:58.330 --> 01:00.750
Our minds clash

01:00.750 --> 01:03.330
But we still want to

01:03.330 --> 01:05.550
Pursue big dreams

01:05.550 --> 01:07.460
The goal's right there

01:07.460 --> 01:09.880
We've just started

01:09.880 --> 01:12.470
I know

01:11.090 --> 01:12.970
It won't be all fun and games

01:12.970 --> 01:14.970
We'll have to face challenges

01:14.970 --> 01:16.640
I know

01:15.930 --> 01:19.890
There'll be hardships along the way

01:19.890 --> 01:21.850
Still, let's go

01:20.940 --> 01:25.020
So long as we're together, each of us will bloom

01:25.020 --> 01:26.070
I'm sure

01:26.070 --> 01:28.610
After a series of transformations

01:27.780 --> 01:29.690
we'll be stars

01:29.690 --> 01:34.780
If we all put our hearts into doing what we love

01:34.780 --> 01:37.410
A new place

01:37.660 --> 01:39.500
will be our goal

01:39.500 --> 01:44.420
Believing in what each of us loves to do

01:44.420 --> 01:47.420
We embrace our excitement

01:47.420 --> 01:49.420
And move forward

01:49.420 --> 01:52.430
Stop being afraid

01:52.430 --> 01:54.800
Just put a big smile on your face

01:54.800 --> 01:57.390
And jump up high

01:57.390 --> 02:02.440
We're all living this moment

02:03.850 --> 02:07.520
Waiting for the spotlight to shine on us

02:10.110 --> 02:11.530
We're so sorry!

02:12.280 --> 02:17.080
"Friends"

02:13.030 --> 02:14.780
You girls...

02:14.780 --> 02:16.530
Why are you apologizing?

02:17.080 --> 02:21.040
I'm sure my daughter took it upon herself to do more than she could manage.

02:21.040 --> 02:23.710
That's how she's always been.

02:25.040 --> 02:28.420
So don't worry and go up to see her! She's been bored here at home!

02:28.920 --> 02:30.050
But...

02:30.050 --> 02:33.380
We heard Honoka-chan came down with a fever.

02:33.800 --> 02:38.600
It started going away about two days ago,
and she's been full of life since this morning!

02:38.600 --> 02:39.470
Honoka!

02:39.470 --> 02:41.930
Oh, Umi-chan, Kotori-chan!

02:41.930 --> 02:43.230
I'm glad you're okay.

02:43.230 --> 02:44.940
You can sit up in bed now, right?

02:44.940 --> 02:45.440
Yeah!

02:45.770 --> 02:48.820
And I'm allowed to eat three pudding cups since I have a cold!

02:49.270 --> 02:51.280
Looks like we were worried for nothing.

02:51.280 --> 02:53.240
Your mom wasn't joking when she said you were full of life.

02:53.240 --> 02:55.990
So how are your legs?

02:55.990 --> 02:57.570
Oh, well...

02:57.570 --> 02:59.450
It's just a minor sprain.

02:59.450 --> 03:01.790
They said it'll be fine once the swelling goes down.

03:04.210 --> 03:06.750
I'm really sorry for messing up the last show, you guys.

03:07.710 --> 03:11.050
It could've been our best performance.

03:11.050 --> 03:13.010
It's not your fault, Honoka.

03:13.010 --> 03:14.090
It's ours.

03:14.090 --> 03:15.130
But...

03:16.180 --> 03:17.090
Here.

03:18.930 --> 03:22.640
Maki played some piano music to help you relax.

03:23.140 --> 03:25.100
Listen to this while you rest.

03:27.900 --> 03:29.900
Thanks, Maki-chan!

03:29.900 --> 03:31.480
Are you out of your mind?!

03:31.480 --> 03:32.860
Did you forget that you have a cold?!

03:36.110 --> 03:38.030
That's what happens when you shout.

03:38.030 --> 03:39.700
She's really happy.

03:41.700 --> 03:45.040
You're still recovering. You need to take it easy.

03:45.040 --> 03:46.410
Thanks.

03:46.410 --> 03:49.290
I think I'm well enough to go to school tomorrow, though.

03:49.290 --> 03:50.540
Really?

03:50.540 --> 03:52.250
Yeah, so I was thinking...

03:52.250 --> 03:56.220
Maybe we could fit in another performance, even if it's a short one.

03:56.220 --> 04:00.720
I mean, there's still some time left until the groups for Love Live are decided!

04:00.720 --> 04:03.470
We can, like, do something to make up for last time.

04:03.890 --> 04:06.060
I was just wondering if that would work.

04:06.810 --> 04:07.890
Honoka...

04:08.940 --> 04:11.810
We're not participating in Love Live.

04:15.780 --> 04:17.400
As the chairwoman pointed out to us,

04:18.110 --> 04:20.410
we might've been overworking ourselves.

04:20.410 --> 04:24.910
She asked us to reflect on what we've been doing this for.

04:26.620 --> 04:30.710
After a group discussion, we decided to withdraw our entry.

04:31.170 --> 04:34.250
In the rankings, µ's is...

04:35.050 --> 04:36.090
gone.

04:37.420 --> 04:38.630
No way.

04:38.630 --> 04:40.760
We're the ones at fault, not you.

04:40.760 --> 04:42.970
We asked too much of you.

04:42.970 --> 04:44.810
No, that's not true.

04:44.810 --> 04:47.350
I'm the one who got carried away.

04:47.350 --> 04:48.640
Honoka-chan...

04:50.060 --> 04:53.480
There's no point in playing the blame game here.

04:53.480 --> 04:55.320
We're <i>all</i> responsible for what happened.

04:55.320 --> 04:59.700
It's your fault that you neglected to manage your condition and overworked yourself,

04:59.700 --> 05:02.410
but we're also at fault for not noticing that.

05:03.320 --> 05:05.540
Ericchi's right.

05:10.710 --> 05:13.710
Honoka-chan looked devastated.

05:13.710 --> 05:17.590
I didn't know we were going to tell her about withdrawing from Love Live so soon.

05:17.590 --> 05:21.720
Even if we didn't tell her, she would've figured it out on her own eventually.

05:21.720 --> 05:23.050
I can't believe this.

05:24.800 --> 05:27.180
We were so close.

05:27.180 --> 05:28.520
Nico-chan...

05:31.810 --> 05:33.940
Onee-chan?

05:35.860 --> 05:37.570
Onee-chan?

05:38.150 --> 05:40.150
The food's ready!

05:40.150 --> 05:42.150
Are you coming down today?

05:43.610 --> 05:45.240
Onee-chan?

05:45.240 --> 05:47.330
Jeez, is she asleep?

06:13.140 --> 06:13.730
Yes?

06:16.400 --> 06:18.360
Did you tell Honoka-chan?

06:21.070 --> 06:22.820
I'll tell her tomorrow.

06:22.820 --> 06:24.950
Make sure you do.

06:24.950 --> 06:26.990
She's one of your best friends, isn't she?

06:28.030 --> 06:28.780
Yeah.

06:33.080 --> 06:34.000
All right!

06:34.000 --> 06:38.040
Now we'll have a brief interview with A-RISE, who qualified with first place in the rankings!

06:38.340 --> 06:39.960
How do you feel?

06:39.960 --> 06:43.420
Well, we couldn't have qualified without the support from our fans!

06:43.420 --> 06:45.510
We're very grateful!

06:45.510 --> 06:47.510
Keep rooting for us, okay?

06:54.140 --> 06:55.980
So they dropped out of the contest?

06:55.980 --> 07:00.440
Yeah, apparently a member had an accident at the school festival.

07:00.440 --> 07:02.150
They climbed up pretty high in the rankings, though.

07:02.150 --> 07:03.690
What a shame.

07:03.690 --> 07:04.950
I know, right?

07:07.320 --> 07:09.160
Don't let it bother you.

07:09.160 --> 07:09.990
I know.

07:12.370 --> 07:14.580
Honoka-chan, I have something to...

07:21.460 --> 07:22.960
She's still brooding.

07:22.960 --> 07:26.800
Coming back to school hasn't cheered her up at all.

07:26.800 --> 07:27.640
Nozomi!

07:27.640 --> 07:28.930
I'm on it!

07:30.930 --> 07:32.600
Nozomi-chan!

07:32.600 --> 07:36.020
I'll squeeze them even harder if you don't stop spacing out!

07:36.730 --> 07:39.520
N-No, please don't!

07:39.520 --> 07:42.020
You've got to learn how to let things go.

07:42.020 --> 07:44.780
You can't stare at that poster forever.

07:46.360 --> 07:48.820
I know, but...

07:48.820 --> 07:50.280
But what?

07:50.280 --> 07:51.530
It's just...

07:51.530 --> 07:52.490
Nozomi!

07:53.040 --> 07:54.580
P-Please don't!

07:54.950 --> 07:58.670
If you stayed that lively, we all wouldn't be so worried.

08:00.000 --> 08:02.550
Or are you trying to get us to worry about you?

08:02.550 --> 08:04.760
No, that's not it.

08:04.760 --> 08:07.170
Today will be your first day back at practice, right?

08:07.170 --> 08:10.760
You'll annoy the hell out of everyone if you show up all gloom and doom.

08:11.350 --> 08:12.680
You're right.

08:12.680 --> 08:15.430
I need to get over this eventually.

08:15.430 --> 08:16.600
That's the spirit.

08:16.600 --> 08:18.980
And besides, our true goal...

08:19.520 --> 08:22.980
is to save the school from closing, remember?

08:24.440 --> 08:25.280
Yeah!

08:26.280 --> 08:27.990
Honoka!

08:28.570 --> 08:30.780
You bring the notebook I texted you about last night?

08:30.780 --> 08:33.280
Oh, I'll give it to you now!

08:33.280 --> 08:35.200
I'll see you guys later.

08:38.290 --> 08:39.870
She's looking better already.

08:44.800 --> 08:46.130
So...

08:46.130 --> 08:48.340
what did the chairwoman say?

08:48.340 --> 08:51.010
That she didn't mean we're no longer allowed to be school idols.

08:51.010 --> 08:52.390
She's okay with us continuing.

08:52.390 --> 08:53.510
Really?

08:53.510 --> 08:54.810
So we can still perform live too?

08:54.810 --> 08:55.680
Yeah.

08:56.350 --> 08:57.390
That's great news!

08:57.390 --> 08:59.230
When should we do the next one?!

08:59.230 --> 09:04.230
Well, I'd love to do a few more before the new student applications are due,

09:04.230 --> 09:06.190
but we shouldn't go crazy with the performances.

09:06.190 --> 09:11.110
Yeah, we should take it slow.
We might wear ourselves out otherwise.

09:11.110 --> 09:12.530
Honoka?

09:12.530 --> 09:14.620
That accident's still on your mind, huh?

09:14.620 --> 09:15.490
Huh?

09:15.950 --> 09:17.160
Well...

09:17.160 --> 09:19.910
It's not like you to worry about that kind of thing.

09:19.910 --> 09:21.000
You think so?

09:21.000 --> 09:24.750
But I guess that means you're getting a sense of perspective.

09:25.250 --> 09:26.670
Perspective...

09:27.420 --> 09:29.630
Huh? Where'd Kotori-chan go?

09:30.590 --> 09:33.390
She went downstairs to make a phone call.

09:33.800 --> 09:35.220
Oh?

09:39.100 --> 09:40.770
Wh-What's the matter?

09:41.230 --> 09:42.770
This...

09:42.770 --> 09:43.980
This...

09:43.980 --> 09:46.230
Th-This needs big help!

09:46.230 --> 09:47.530
What?

09:47.940 --> 09:47.980
Announcement

09:47.940 --> 09:47.980
New Student Application Information for the Next Academic Year

09:53.910 --> 09:55.200
Does this mean...

09:55.200 --> 09:59.160
They released survey results for which high schools middle schoolers are interested in!

09:59.160 --> 10:01.660
Supposedly, far more students have
expressed interest in ours compared to last year!

10:04.120 --> 10:05.460
That means...

10:06.090 --> 10:07.210
...the school...

10:07.210 --> 10:09.380
...will stay open!

10:09.380 --> 10:12.170
W-We don't know about the year after that, though!

10:12.170 --> 10:13.930
So we'll have a class below us next year?

10:13.930 --> 10:14.390
Yeah!

10:14.390 --> 10:16.800
Yes!

10:18.640 --> 10:20.850
Kotori-chan!

10:23.230 --> 10:24.520
Wh-What?

10:25.270 --> 10:26.560
Look!

10:26.560 --> 10:27.980
H-Huh?

10:27.980 --> 10:29.780
We did it! We really did it!

10:29.780 --> 10:31.990
The school won't close down!

10:29.780 --> 10:29.820
Otonokizaka Academy Board Chair

10:29.780 --> 10:29.820
Otonokizaka Academy Principal

10:29.780 --> 10:29.820
New Student Application Information for the Next Academic Year

10:29.780 --> 10:29.820
Announcement

10:34.360 --> 10:35.610
I can't believe it...

10:35.610 --> 10:36.990
But we actually did it!

10:38.330 --> 10:39.240
Yeah!

10:41.250 --> 10:42.830
Horosho.

10:42.830 --> 10:44.160
Really?!

10:44.160 --> 10:45.370
Yep!

10:45.370 --> 10:46.380
I'm so happy!

10:46.380 --> 10:48.500
You guys did it!

10:49.750 --> 10:51.170
Isn't it great?

10:51.170 --> 10:51.920
Yeah!

10:51.920 --> 10:54.510
Please look after me next year!

10:55.340 --> 10:56.640
For that to happen,

10:56.640 --> 10:59.430
you'll have to pass the entrance exam first.

10:59.430 --> 11:01.390
Yeah, I'll study hard!

11:02.890 --> 11:06.400
I wish my little sister Yukiho wanted to come here too.

11:06.400 --> 11:09.860
Oh, we were talking about that the other day and it sounded like she was considering it.

11:09.860 --> 11:10.820
Really?!

11:10.820 --> 11:11.690
All right!

11:12.440 --> 11:14.490
Hey, what are we doing about our next performance?

11:14.490 --> 11:19.030
Good question. We aren't in a hurry to perform anymore.

11:19.450 --> 11:21.040
Yeah...

11:22.870 --> 11:23.790
Um...

11:24.540 --> 11:28.380
I have to buy something on my way home, so I gotta go.

11:28.380 --> 11:29.040
Huh?

11:29.040 --> 11:30.920
What are you gonna get?

11:30.920 --> 11:31.750
Uh...

11:31.750 --> 11:33.130
Want me to come with you?

11:33.130 --> 11:35.420
No, it's okay.

11:35.420 --> 11:36.260
Bye!

11:39.800 --> 11:42.930
Kotori-chan looked kind of down.

11:42.930 --> 11:44.890
Nozomi's been worrying about her.

11:44.890 --> 11:46.810
She noticed something was wrong right before the school festival.

11:46.810 --> 11:49.650
She said something might be troubling Kotori.

11:50.560 --> 11:52.690
She's been like this for that long?

12:05.500 --> 12:09.210
It'll just get more and more painful the longer you put it off.

12:09.210 --> 12:09.920
I know.

12:10.580 --> 12:12.670
You've already decided, right?

12:12.670 --> 12:13.340
Yeah.

12:14.920 --> 12:21.510
But I don't know what Honoka-chan would've said if I talked to her about it before I made up my mind.

12:21.510 --> 12:24.640
When I think about that, it becomes so hard to tell her.

12:31.360 --> 12:33.650
To kick things off...

12:33.650 --> 12:35.650
Nico-nico Smile!

12:35.650 --> 12:38.450
Does everyone have a drink?

12:38.450 --> 12:40.950
The school announced that it won't be closing,

12:38.450 --> 12:45.120
Celebrating school survival!!

12:40.950 --> 12:45.120
so I'd like to say a word as your club president!

12:48.870 --> 12:55.670
Looking back, it's been such a long time since µ's was formed and I was chosen as the president!

12:55.670 --> 12:58.970
As the only member in the Idol Research Club, I stayed strong!

12:58.970 --> 13:01.840
And now I have so many members to whom I can reminisce—

13:01.840 --> 13:03.100
Cheers!

13:03.100 --> 13:04.430
Wait for me to finish!

13:04.430 --> 13:07.390
Man, I'm so hungry, I could eat a horse!

13:07.390 --> 13:10.230
Nico-chan, you'd better grab some for yourself before there's nothing left!

13:10.230 --> 13:11.730
What a boorish girl.

13:13.440 --> 13:14.860
Everyone!

13:15.190 --> 13:17.440
The rice is ready!

13:18.280 --> 13:20.240
It's rice time!

13:20.240 --> 13:22.490
You seem relieved.

13:22.950 --> 13:24.530
Well, I am.

13:24.530 --> 13:26.870
I feel like a great weight's been lifted from my shoulders.

13:27.370 --> 13:29.870
It's a good thing you joined µ's, huh?

13:29.870 --> 13:31.870
I don't know about that.

13:31.870 --> 13:36.670
Honestly, I feel like the result would've been the same even if I hadn't joined.

13:36.670 --> 13:38.460
That's where you're wrong.

13:38.460 --> 13:42.130
µ's must have nine members, no more and no less.

13:42.130 --> 13:43.680
That's what my cards told me.

13:44.300 --> 13:45.890
Is that so?

13:48.390 --> 13:50.930
We don't have to worry about the school shutting down anymore.

13:50.930 --> 13:53.020
But I should still pull myself together and work hard!

13:56.230 --> 13:57.900
Kotori...

13:57.900 --> 13:59.740
Now isn't a good time.

14:01.490 --> 14:02.570
Kotori.

14:07.410 --> 14:11.040
Could I have everyone's attention? I need to tell you all something.

14:14.290 --> 14:15.290
Did you hear anything about this?

14:15.290 --> 14:16.340
No.

14:16.340 --> 14:17.540
You see...

14:19.050 --> 14:22.420
I know this is unexpected, but Kotori will be going abroad to study.

14:25.090 --> 14:27.550
She's leaving Japan in two weeks.

14:34.390 --> 14:35.560
What?

14:35.560 --> 14:36.690
No way.

14:36.690 --> 14:38.980
Wait, what's going on?

14:39.860 --> 14:44.400
I've always wanted to study costume design.

14:44.400 --> 14:49.160
A school official who's acquainted with my mom offered me a spot in a program, and I accepted.

14:50.580 --> 14:51.660
I'm sorry.

14:52.250 --> 14:55.920
I meant to tell you about this sooner, but...

14:55.920 --> 14:59.630
Kotori didn't want to break the news to us while we were in such high spirits

14:59.630 --> 15:01.840
before the school festival performance.

15:01.840 --> 15:03.130
That explains your mood lately.

15:03.970 --> 15:06.470
You're not coming back once you leave, are you?

15:08.390 --> 15:11.720
Probably not until I graduate from high school.

15:21.570 --> 15:24.570
Why didn't you tell me?

15:26.450 --> 15:29.410
As I said, there was the school festival performance to consider.

15:30.080 --> 15:31.910
You knew about it.

15:33.580 --> 15:34.620
I...

15:37.460 --> 15:39.630
Why didn't you tell me?

15:39.630 --> 15:42.300
I get that you couldn't announce it because of our show.

15:42.300 --> 15:46.380
But Umi-chan, you, and I have always been together!

15:46.380 --> 15:47.890
Honoka!

15:47.890 --> 15:49.930
Please try to understand how Kotori-chan feels—

15:49.930 --> 15:50.890
I can't!

15:50.890 --> 15:52.890
She's leaving!

15:52.890 --> 15:54.350
After being together all this time,

15:54.350 --> 15:56.390
we'll be separated from each other!

15:56.390 --> 15:58.150
Yet...

15:58.150 --> 16:00.730
I tried to tell you a bunch of times.

16:01.320 --> 16:04.780
But you were so focused on the live show.

16:04.780 --> 16:06.860
Love Live was the only thing on your mind.

16:06.860 --> 16:11.120
So I was going to tell you after the show.

16:11.120 --> 16:13.870
I was going to ask you to help me decide.

16:14.660 --> 16:17.830
But you collapsed.

16:18.620 --> 16:21.630
I wanted to tell you everything.

16:21.630 --> 16:24.090
I wanted to discuss it with you before anyone else!

16:24.090 --> 16:27.630
After all, you were my first friend!

16:28.090 --> 16:30.140
You've always been there for me as a friend!

16:30.430 --> 16:34.390
Of course... Of course I wanted to tell you!

16:35.770 --> 16:37.230
Kotori-chan!

16:40.350 --> 16:43.400
It seems she struggled to make a decision for a long time.

16:43.980 --> 16:47.400
Actually, I'd go so far as to say she didn't want to go.

16:48.110 --> 16:50.160
She was always thinking about you,

16:50.700 --> 16:54.080
wondering what you'd say if she asked you.

16:54.620 --> 16:57.200
She didn't intend to keep it a secret from you.

16:57.200 --> 17:00.960
She really <i>was</i> planning on talking to you about it after the show.

17:02.880 --> 17:04.420
Please try to understand how she feels.

17:11.550 --> 17:12.930
You told her, didn't you?

17:13.600 --> 17:14.300
Yeah.

17:15.850 --> 17:17.600
Did she understand?

17:25.440 --> 17:26.780
Go to bed soon.

17:31.990 --> 17:32.030
no subject

17:31.990 --> 17:32.030
I never noticed...

17:39.750 --> 17:39.790
I only thought about myself and didn't

17:39.750 --> 17:39.790
stop to consider how everyone else felt.

17:39.750 --> 17:39.790
So...

17:39.750 --> 17:39.790
I'm sorry, Kotori-chan.

17:47.380 --> 17:49.970
Even if I apologize, it's already too late.

18:10.490 --> 18:11.860
They're amazing.

18:13.320 --> 18:17.450
I'll never catch up to them. It's impossible.

18:23.120 --> 18:26.540
What have I been doing?

18:29.670 --> 18:30.710
Morning!

18:30.710 --> 18:31.630
Morning.

18:31.630 --> 18:33.930
Hey, did you do the handout for first period?

18:33.930 --> 18:35.050
Morning!

18:35.050 --> 18:36.510
Look, she's asleep.

18:36.510 --> 18:37.470
I'm awake.

18:37.470 --> 18:38.760
Jeez.

18:38.760 --> 18:41.810
Hey, you didn't come to school with Kotori-chan today?

18:41.810 --> 18:43.140
No.

18:43.140 --> 18:45.350
I heard the news from Sonoda-san this morning.

18:45.350 --> 18:47.690
Kotori-chan's going to study abroad, right?

18:47.690 --> 18:48.400
Yeah.

18:48.400 --> 18:49.980
It won't be the same
around here without her.

18:51.110 --> 18:51.940
Yeah.

18:52.940 --> 18:54.200
Honoka!

19:02.290 --> 19:03.330
A live show?

19:03.330 --> 19:05.710
Yeah, we talked it over and came to an agreement.

19:05.710 --> 19:09.590
We should do a live show with all nine of us before Kotori leaves.

19:09.590 --> 19:11.960
We're going to tell Kotori-chan about it when she gets here.

19:11.960 --> 19:15.840
We'll send her off with a huge, lively event!

19:15.840 --> 19:17.430
Calm down!

19:17.430 --> 19:19.300
Nico-chan ,what was that for?!

19:19.300 --> 19:20.600
You should be glad I held back!

19:20.600 --> 19:22.180
Hiss!

19:24.060 --> 19:26.100
Are you still feeling down?

19:26.810 --> 19:28.730
Let's lighten up.

19:28.730 --> 19:32.070
This will be the last live
performance with all nine of us.

19:37.660 --> 19:40.530
If I had paid more attention to the people around me,

19:40.530 --> 19:42.580
things wouldn't have turned out this way.

19:43.120 --> 19:45.830
Y-You don't have to take all the blame!

19:45.830 --> 19:48.920
But it's entirely my fault this happened!

19:48.920 --> 19:50.500
You little...

19:50.500 --> 19:53.800
It's arrogant to think it's all your fault.

19:53.800 --> 19:54.590
But...

19:54.590 --> 19:57.010
What good will come of talking about this here and now?

19:57.010 --> 20:00.050
It's unproductive, and nobody enjoys talking about it.

20:00.050 --> 20:03.220
And we can always aim for the next Love Live.

20:03.220 --> 20:05.730
Yeah, we'll make it next time for sure.

20:05.730 --> 20:07.940
Getting depressed over this is a waste of time.

20:07.940 --> 20:09.940
What'll we do after we make it to the contest?

20:09.940 --> 20:10.810
Huh?

20:10.810 --> 20:13.400
We stopped the school from closing already.

20:13.400 --> 20:15.070
What's the point of competing now?

20:15.990 --> 20:17.570
Honoka-chan...

20:17.570 --> 20:19.410
And we'd never make it to the top anyway.

20:19.410 --> 20:23.580
We won't reach A-RISE's level no matter how much we practice.

20:23.950 --> 20:26.460
Do you really mean that?

20:28.170 --> 20:30.080
If you do, I'll make you pay.

20:33.420 --> 20:35.340
I won't let you get away with saying that!

20:35.340 --> 20:36.130
Stop!

20:36.130 --> 20:37.880
Get off me!

20:37.880 --> 20:40.720
I joined µ's because I thought you took this seriously!

20:40.720 --> 20:44.680
I thought you were serious about wanting to be an idol!

20:44.680 --> 20:47.140
I bet on this group!

20:47.140 --> 20:49.690
And you're going to give up just because of this?!

20:50.190 --> 20:53.440
This alone was enough to make you lose all motivation?!

20:55.530 --> 20:58.200
Then what do you think we should do, Honoka?

20:59.110 --> 21:00.280
What do you want to do?

21:03.870 --> 21:04.950
Answer me.

21:05.830 --> 21:09.330
<i>This will be the last live
performance with all nine of us.</i>

21:13.210 --> 21:14.290
I quit.

21:16.590 --> 21:20.680
I quit being a school idol.

21:40.320 --> 21:41.740
Honoka-chan...

22:02.430 --> 22:05.430
I never knew you were that kind of person!

22:08.470 --> 22:09.890
You're terrible!

22:10.680 --> 22:11.770
You're...

22:12.560 --> 22:14.650
a terrible person!

22:17.070 --> 22:19.780
Chase it fervently

22:17.070 --> 22:19.780
sunao ni oikakete

22:19.780 --> 22:22.740
Chase it courageously

22:19.780 --> 22:22.740
yuuki de oikakete

22:22.740 --> 22:28.370
Small wishes make up our vision for tomorrow

22:22.740 --> 22:28.370
chiisana negai ga ashita wo tsukuru

22:28.370 --> 22:34.460
And they might just come true if everyone wishes for it

22:28.370 --> 22:34.460
dekiru kamo minna ga nozomu nara

22:34.460 --> 22:37.170
Try harder than everyone else

22:34.460 --> 22:37.170
dare yori ganbacchae

22:37.170 --> 22:41.550
And never lose your zeal

22:37.170 --> 22:41.550
tonikaku jounetsu no mama ni

22:41.550 --> 22:46.890
As you walk down that stormy path toward your goal

22:41.550 --> 22:46.890
mezasu no wa kirei na kaze fuku michi

22:46.890 --> 22:52.810
Let's raise our arms as though they were wings

22:46.890 --> 22:52.810
hane no you ni ude agete

22:52.810 --> 22:58.320
And fly toward our bright future

22:52.810 --> 22:58.320
mabushii mirai e to tobu yo

22:59.610 --> 23:02.740
That's when you'll hear us living life to the fullest

22:59.610 --> 23:02.740
kitto seishun ga kikoeru

23:02.740 --> 23:06.160
That's the moment you'll hear it

23:02.740 --> 23:06.160
sono shunkan ni kikoeru

23:06.160 --> 23:11.490
The smiles on our faces won't ever waver

23:06.160 --> 23:11.490
egao nara itsu no hi mo daijoubu

23:11.490 --> 23:14.370
That's when you'll hear us living life to the fullest

23:11.490 --> 23:14.370
kitto seishun ga kikoeru

23:14.370 --> 23:17.170
I want you to be there for that moment

23:14.370 --> 23:17.170
sono shunkan ga mitai ne

23:17.960 --> 23:22.460
You're by my side

23:17.960 --> 23:22.460
tonari ni kimi ga ite

23:20.800 --> 23:23.630
What a delightful sight

23:20.800 --> 23:23.630
ureshii keshiki

23:23.880 --> 23:29.510
And I'm by yours

23:23.880 --> 23:29.510
tonari wa kimi nan da

23:37.520 --> 23:42.030
Next time on <i>Love Live</i>: "µ's Music Start!"
